<title>SINGAPORE: Apollo 96 net profit down 19.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Apollo 96 net profit down 19.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				4.23 vs  5.25</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		    2.50 vs  2.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     2.70 vs  3.40</p>
<p>    Turnover				 53.86 vs 51.85</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.02 vs  0.23</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    2.73 vs  2.55</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		8.48 vs  7.36</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  7.55 vs  8.86</p>
<p>    Tax					 3.32 vs  3.61</p>
<p>Note - Apollo Enterprises Ltd is a hotel operator and property developer. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
